<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Northam trims Dec qtr loss, output rises.</title>
<headline>Northam trims Dec qtr loss, output rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net loss before capital spending  1.78 vs 7.39 loss</p>
<p>    Capital spending			3.71 vs 2.18</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled			430,000 vs 400,000</p>
<p>    Head grade (gram/t)		   5.97 vs 6.13</p>
<p>Precious metals in</p>
<p>     concentrates (oz)		  85,818 vs 75,365</p>
<p>    Sales				   124.34 vs 96.26</p>
<p>    Cost of sales			 127.31 vs 105.82</p>
<p>Full name: Northam Platinum Ltd, managed by Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
